  "instructions": [
    "Heat the avocado oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the sliced onion and cook until caramelized, about 8 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic, sliced carrots, and sliced celery, and cook for an additional 4 minutes.",
    "Add the caraway seeds, smoked paprika, and cayenne pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the german sausage and cook until browned, about 4-5 minutes.",
    "Pour in the vegetable broth and apple cider vinegar, and bring to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and let simmer for 10 minutes, or until the flavors have melded together.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve the sausage and broth hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs, if desired.",
    "Transfer the dish to a lacquerware bowl and serve immediately."
  ],
